Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.41,0:22:23.94,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\blur4.5\3c&HE890E3&\t(80,80,\3c&HCD7E9A&)\t(285,285,\3c&HDC7BBE&)}Um avião voa até o horizonte
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:25.36,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\3c&HC68396&}Um avião voa até o horizonte
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.36,0:22:28.98,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur4.5\3c&HE577E1&\t(877,1630,\3c&HB57F91&)}Um avião voa até o horizonte
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:37.04,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,670)\blur4.5\3c&HCA76CD&\t(3878,5546,\3c&HE0A9E2&)}Algo que eu tranquei no meu coração está transbordando
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:41.75,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur4.5\3c&HAC4F93&\t(764,3308,\3c&HDC88DF&)}Guardei os sentimentos que queria expressar
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.66,0:22:44.26,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\blur4.5\3c&H88CA87&\t(305,305,\3c&HBC5DA6&)}E os transformei em palavras que não posso dizer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.26,0:22:45.63,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\3c&HD799DA&)}E os transformei em palavras que não posso dizer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.63,0:22:48.60,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur4.5\3c&HBF0074&}E os transformei em palavras que não posso dizer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.92,0:22:56.81,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,900)\blur4.5\3c&HDE9B69&\t(2863,3572,\3c&HA850A4&)}Não posso ser honesta até o fim
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.81,0:23:03.36,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5\3c&HC7181E&}Eu cortei os laços que nos mantinham unidos
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:06.36,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5\3c&H973780&}Vá e se liberte
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:13.74,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\3c&HFFFFFF&\t(8,759,\blur4.5\3c&HD20022&)}Nosso plano foi jogado ao vento até desaparecer completamente
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:18.29,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,700)\blur4.5\3c&H9302AF&}Se eu apenas pudesse dizer que queria te ver
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.75,0:23:26.89,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5\3c&H340099&}Se conseguisse me livrar desse desgosto sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.89,0:23:31.40,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur4.5\3c&H861778&}Quem sabe eu pudesse estar aqui com você
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.40,0:23:36.73,ED2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,2000)\blur4.5\3c&HDE5CCE&}Olá, olá, sozinho
